WEBVTT

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:30.434
It doesn't discriminate:

00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:33.434
men, women, children, elderly --

00:02:33.458 --> 00:02:35.726
all of us can feel fear,

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:39.208
but only as long as we are on our own.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:43.101
Fearlessness takes two.

00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:47.208
It only works if and when
we show up for each other.

00:02:48.125 --> 00:02:50.434
Show up so that your neighbor,

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:53.292
your colleague, your friend has courage.

00:02:54.167 --> 00:02:56.542
And they will do the same for you.

00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:02.059
A lot has been made of my own role
in the presidential election